docs[1]{path,scope}:
  ARCHITECTURE.md,project
body: "Node 22 default reporter emits name: UnitRefusal and error: Unit dimensions differ. Node 26 spec reporter emits UnitRefusal: Unit dimensions differ. The classifier must accept both and still reject syntax and load failures."
